WearLoop bundles an unmodified Fashionpedia YOLOv8n ONNX model published by
louisJLN/yolo8-fashionpedia. Its embedded Ultralytics AGPL-3.0 notice is retained.
The upstream model card separately declares MIT; that declaration is preserved
and is not represented as removing the underlying Ultralytics AGPL notice.
See third_party/fashionpedia/README.md and MODEL_PROVENANCE.json for exact
artifact hashes, revision, source/configuration material and limitations.

The first-party modifications include the Flutter application, wardrobe
storage and local inference integration, UI, localization, brand assets,
generated demonstration clothing assets, tests and build/preparation tools.
The AGPL open-source distribution was prepared on 2026-10-29.

